From: codeandsolder <codeandsolder@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: pcs: qcom-ipq9574: recalibrate MPPE SGMII on every media link up

The first-link-down packet blackhole is fixed by deferring the first
UNIPHY SGMII calibration until the external PHY reports media link up.

However, a supervised nine-second copper flap on an already accepted
boot reproduces the same bidirectional packet blackhole: phylink
reports PCS link-up success and carrier 1G, but GMAC RX does not
advance for 30 seconds. The second pcs_link_up() does not reconfigure
UNIPHY because its interface mode is already set to SGMII. The
on-device watchdog recovered without physical intervention.

For IPQ5332 MPPE index0 out-of-band SGMII, calibrate the PCS on each
media link-up callback, before phylink enables the MAC. Keep other
PCS instances, in-band SGMII and 2500BASE-X unchanged. This extends
the proven first-link ordering to subsequent carrier transitions.

Experiment-only: source compiled and hardware-flap re-test required.

Signed-off-by: codeandsolder <codeandsolder@gmail.com>
---
--- a/drivers/net/pcs/pcs-qcom-ipq9574.c
+++ b/drivers/net/pcs/pcs-qcom-ipq9574.c
@@ -1000,26 +1000,33 @@ static void ipq_pcs_link_up(struct phyli
 	}
 
 	/*
-	 * Complete deferred first-time out-of-band MPPE SGMII setup only
-	 * after the external copper PHY has established its media link.
+	 * Configure MPPE SGMII after each external PHY media link-up,
+	 * including recovery after a carrier loss. The PHY SerDes and
+	 * UNIPHY may have lost frame alignment even though their
+	 * reported carrier and calibration status are healthy.
+	 *
+	 * This callback runs before phylink's MAC link-up callback.
 	 */
 	if (qpcs->mppe && index == 0 &&
 	    neg_mode == PHYLINK_PCS_NEG_OUTBAND &&
-	    interface == PHY_INTERFACE_MODE_SGMII &&
-	    qpcs->interface != interface) {
+	    interface == PHY_INTERFACE_MODE_SGMII) {
+		bool initial = qpcs->interface != interface;
 		ret = ipq_pcs_config_mode(qpcs, interface);
 		if (ret) {
-			dev_err(qpcs->dev, "Deferred SGMII mode setup failed: %d\n", ret);
+			dev_err(qpcs->dev, "SGMII media-link mode setup failed: %d\n", ret);
 			return;
 		}
 
 		ret = ipq_pcs_config_sgmii(qpcs, index, neg_mode, interface);
 		if (ret) {
-			dev_err(qpcs->dev, "Deferred SGMII force mode failed: %d\n", ret);
+			dev_err(qpcs->dev, "SGMII media-link force mode failed: %d\n", ret);
 			return;
 		}
 
-		dev_info(qpcs->dev, "wave7-diag: first-media SGMII mode ready\n");
+		if (initial)
+			dev_info(qpcs->dev, "wave7-diag: first-media SGMII mode ready\n");
+		else
+			dev_info(qpcs->dev, "wave7-diag: relink-media SGMII mode ready\n");
 	}
 
 	switch (interface) {
